  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::IntroTransition
  introBackground: {fileID: 1357855687}
  introTextGroup: {fileID: 267598224}
  introText: {fileID: 267598225}
  fadeDuration: 0.8
  readingDuration: 10
  introMessage: 'CUBA - PRESENT DAY


    Since 1962, the United States has maintained
    broad trade restrictions on Cuba. These restrictions, alongside domestic economic
    challenges and fuel shortages, have placed pressure on everyday life.


    You
    are responsible for a family living in Havana. Manage food, fuel, medicine, money,
    and health while navigating shortages and difficult decisions.


    YOUR OBJECTIVE:
    SURVIVE SEVEN DAYS.'
